{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歐元區投資信心下跌，並低過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>歐洲經濟研究院ZEW公布，反映投資信心的經濟景氣指數，10月放緩至18.5。市場原本預期由9月的25.8跌至23.6。數據放緩反映投資者對未來半年經濟前景的樂觀程度下降。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T15:21:47.207827+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:57:56.699869+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:17:46.470366+00:00","content_hash":"91665d56718eff26604d4d7e8074140fc14970f8d33fe89a893430c7ff76e58f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}